gdb/image/upload/t_thumb/scxt60.jpg"}], "slug": "threedays", "storyline": "The storyline of Threedays encompasses diverse locations, ranging from Chornobaivsk Airport to Snake Island, from the cruiser Moscow to the Azovstal Plant. The tasks inspired by real events awaiting you will be challenging and dangerous, but it's precisely what makes them even more thrilling. Each battle will test your endurance, reaction speed, and ability to work as a team. In our game, we use 3D scans of Ukrainian cultural and architectural landmarks, authentic destroyed enemy equipment and gear to achieve maximum realism in terms of enemies and environment.", "summary": "Threedays \u2014 a tactical shooter inspired by real events of the war in Ukraine. Take part in the fight for freedom as real-life soldiers, each with a unique story. The game offers a deep narrative, authentic atmosphere, and dynamic gameplay.", "themes": [{"id": 1, "name": "Action"}, {"id": 22, "name": "Historical"}], "url": "https://www.igdb.com/games/threedays", "videos": [{"id": 154812, "name": "Dev Diary", "video_id": "c4djofcYLn0", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=c4djofcYLn0", "title": "\u041f\u0440\u043e\u0446\u0435\u0441 \u043e\u0446\u0438\u0444\u0440\u0443\u0432\u0430\u043d\u043d\u044f \u0432\u043e\u0457\u043d\u0430 \u0434\u043b\u044f \u0433\u0440\u0438", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/c4djofcYLn0/sddefault.jpg"}, {"id": 154813, "name": "Cinematic Trailer", "video_id": "rH6DNe_wGxA", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=rH6DNe_wGxA", "title": "-\u0442\u0438 \u0437\u043d\u0430\u0454\u0448, \u044f\u043a \u043d\u0435 \u0431\u043e\u044f\u0442\u0438\u0441\u044f? -\u0442\u0440\u0435\u0431\u0430 \u0441\u0442\u0430\u0442\u0438 \u0432\u0456\u043b\u044c\u043d\u0438\u043c. \u041c\u0430\u0440\u0456\u0443\u043f\u043e\u043b\u044c", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/rH6DNe_wGxA/maxresdefault.jpg"}, {"id": 154811, "name": "Gameplay Trailer", "video_id": "_zYNi2DAqaU", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=_zYNi2DA